EXPECT_EXIT | 0 | mutant 1 builds
RUN | $T/m/m1 | walk | $T/H2/@.apps/rta/rules.pdl | $T/s1/l.txt | joe | s
EXPECT_EXIT | 0 | MUTANT 1 walks onto a glyph the rules do not list
# ---- m2: the in-car refusal dropped
